{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人莊子璇自加人女團MYNT後除了努力練習唱歌跳舞，更不時發揮其設計創意，為隊友配襯穿搭，相當積極。</p><p>MYNT於9月正式釋出第二首派台歌《純粹好感》MV，不過MV男主角在全片中卻全程未有正式露面，樣貌被製作團隊巧妙隱藏起來，相當神秘，而直至日</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T07:21:27.139656+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T07:01:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T07:14:40.548234+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T07:14:40.548234+00:00","content_hash":"b0c2f851fb73ae6a10e380cb079f0ca0fce3016978820828e1ebb3bbac5d6f1e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}